<title>USA: Wang, Kodak in talks over imaging unit--paper.</title>
<headline>Wang, Kodak in talks over imaging unit--paper.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wang Laboratories Inc is negotiating to sell its imaging software business to Eastman Kodak in a deal the could be worth several hundred million dollars, The Boston Globe reported Thursday.</p>
<p>The newspaper, citing unnamed sources, said the discussions between Wang and Kodak were serious and focusing on price.</p>
<p>Officials for both companies were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
